# MaCSad public research application

Import PublicClosing from "./public_closing.lg".
Import PublicHero from "./public_hero.lg".
Import PublicMasthead from "./public_masthead.lg".
Import ResearchLedger from "./research_ledger.lg".

The public shell composes independently owned publication components and keeps
the private administrative control plane out of the generated surface.

## Component MacsAdPublic:
    View:
        css "* { box-sizing: border-box; } .public-shell { min-height: 100vh; color: #172b35; background: #f5f2e9; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; } .content { max-width: 1240px; margin: auto; padding: 58px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 90px; }"
        div [class="public-shell"]:
            PublicMasthead
            PublicHero
            main [class="content"]:
                ResearchLedger
                PublicPrinciples
            PublicFooter
